    "description": "Are you a skilled Backend Developer looking for your next big career move? Airtel India Capital India in Srinagar offers you the perfect platform to grow professionally and personally.\n\nAbout Airtel India Capital India:\nAirtel India Capital India is a leading organization in the On-site sector, committed to excellence, innovation, and employee growth. We offer a dynamic work environment where talent is recognized and rewarded.\n\nKey Responsibilities:\n• Optimize application performance and ensure high availability\n• Ensure code security and follow best practices for data protection\n• Mentor junior developers and conduct knowledge-sharing sessions\n• Contribute to system architecture and technical design decisions\n• Deploy and manage applications on cloud platforms like AWS, Azure, or GCP\n• Design, develop and maintain scalable software applications\n• Write and execute unit tests and integration tests\n\nRequired Skills & Qualifications:\n• MBA from a recognized university\n• 12-20 years of relevant experience\n• Proficiency in Docker\n• Proficiency in Rust\n• Proficiency in Agile/Scrum\n• Proficiency in Machine Learning\n• Proficiency in CI/CD\n• Proficiency in AWS\n• Proficiency in Go\n• Proficiency in Git\n\nWork Mode: On-site - Work from our office\n\nWhat We Offer:\n• Annual paid leaves and casual leaves\n• Comprehensive health insurance for self and family\n• Modern office with recreational facilities\n• Annual performance appraisal\n• Competitive salary with performance-linked incentives\n• Maternity and paternity leave\n• Salary Range: 35 LPA - 70 LPA per annum\n\nLocation: Srinagar, Jammu & Kashmir, India\n\nIf you are excited about this opportunity, apply now and take the next step in your career journey with Airtel India Capital India!",
